{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1453522-deviant-and-crossovers","id":1453522,"title":"Deviant and crossovers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Deviant: The Renegades"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-06-25T23:26:54-07:00","id":1453522,"title":"Deviant and crossovers","content":"So I finally got a hold of the full version pdf of Deviant the Renegdes, and I must admit I was a bit skeptical after Beast the Primordial. But I took that leap if faith, I started reading, and wouldn't you know it, I was impressed with how well it was put together. And before even getting to the actual rules (I'm still on the setting chapter) my mind started envisioning plans for a crossover, specifically with Demon the Descent and Promethean the Created. I feel the overlap of themes makes the entire thing stronger, and the similarly transient and migratory lifestyle of these splats makes for natural allies. But I was wondering, how would you go about doing something like this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26101-grevnor","name":"Grevnor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-26T07:01:35-07:00","id":1453546,"title":"","content":"Demon would work well indeed, but not so sure about Promethean\u2026<br /> <br /> Oh wait forgot about the Insatiate there. I guess they\u2019d work for the bckground lore\u2026<br /> <br /> What were the themes you had in mind?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-26T08:04:19-07:00","id":1453551,"title":"","content":"I mostly just reacted to the similar themes between Progenitors, Demiurges and the God-Machine, and felt that the web of conspiracies could be widened, with conspiracies also being Infrastructure. There is also the similaritues between the Deviant and Promethean condition - they are sort of mirror images of each other. Add the Demons and Angels, and add the Qashmallim to the mix, and you have multiple overlapping threads between the three splats. Not sure which themes I would want to focus on, except Inhumanity, Vagrants/Fugitives and Conspiracy is obviously themes that resonate quite strongly with all of them in one form or another. Mostly just wanted a creative sounding board, see if any interesting suggestions pop up.<br /> <br /> Edit: Not sure if I'm making sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26101-grevnor","name":"Grevnor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-26T20:11:35-07:00","id":1453622,"title":"","content":"If there\u2019s Unchained involved then don\u2019t even <i>think</i> about choosing a threat level below Metamorphosis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-27T00:21:15-07:00","id":1453629,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1453522-deviant-and-crossovers?p=1453622#post1453622\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If there\u2019s Unchained involved then don\u2019t even <i>think</i> about choosing a threat level below Metamorphosis.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or, y'know, lean into the mode of play where you're Uncalled, running a single highly-rated Cover and leveraging its Legend, pursuing your Cipher over a long time if at all, and/or avoiding compromise like the plague.<br /> <br /> i.e. Stick with demons who're staying at low Primum if you're going with a lower Threat Level.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-27T09:25:40-07:00","id":1453654,"title":"","content":"Still finishing up on the setting chapter, but I had a hunch Deviants would be on the lower end of the power scale.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26101-grevnor","name":"Grevnor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-01T19:13:51-07:00","id":1454032,"title":"","content":"I'm planning a crossover with Mummy. The Arisen make perfect progenitors. They need capable and even powerful mortal agents, so creating occult rites to empower their cultists seems like a natural fit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12488-jeremysbrain","name":"Jeremysbrain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-01T19:53:30-07:00","id":1454037,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jeremysbrain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1453522-deviant-and-crossovers?p=1454032#post1454032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm planning a crossover with Mummy. The Arisen make perfect progenitors. They need capable and even powerful mortal agents, so creating occult rites to empower their cultists seems like a natural fit.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Arisen <i>are</i> those capable and powerful agents. Their cults manage their influence through sorcery and good old-fashioned political/familial/socio-economic connections. All four primary forms of Endlessness explored in Mummy are ritually achieved or achievable. A progenitor might arise from the background of a Scorpion Cult, but the Arisen don't have the time or general inclination to orchestrate the particular mechanism of cracking open a soul just so if a method for it doesn't drop into their lap.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-01T20:19:08-07:00","id":1454042,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1453522-deviant-and-crossovers?p=1454037#post1454037\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Arisen <i>are</i> those capable and powerful agents. Their cults manage their influence through sorcery and good old-fashioned political/familial/socio-economic connections. All four primary forms of Endlessness explored in Mummy are ritually achieved or achievable. A progenitor might arise from the background of a Scorpion Cult, but the Arisen don't have the time or general inclination to orchestrate the particular mechanism of cracking open a soul just so if a method for it doesn't drop into their lap.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well that is very inside the box thinking and kind of thread crappy. But thanks anyway I guess. <br /> <br /> Also, I said <i>mortal</i> agents","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12488-jeremysbrain","name":"Jeremysbrain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-01T21:01:30-07:00","id":1454050,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jeremysbrain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1453522-deviant-and-crossovers?p=1454042#post1454042\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well that is very inside the box thinking and kind of thread crappy. But thanks anyway I guess.<br /> <br /> Also, I said <i>mortal</i> agents</div> </div> </div> </div><spa